{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"8a9f711d-2cff-4f75-9431-b9d5b2d30c42","step":{"id":"s1","script":"A string fixed at both ends can form a standing wave. This pattern has three loops; the curve shows one extreme position.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Standing waves on a string"},{"op":"figure","id":"string","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-0.5,6.5],"y":[-1.6,1.6],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"rest","from":[0,0],"to":[6,0],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"fn","id":"crest","y":"sin(pi*x/2)","domain":[0,6]},{"kind":"point","id":"endleft","at":[0,0]},{"kind":"point","id":"endright","at":[6,0]},{"kind":"text","at":[0,-0.35],"text":"fixed","size":"small"},{"kind":"text","at":[6,-0.35],"text":"fixed","size":"small"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"8a9f711d-2cff-4f75-9431-b9d5b2d30c42","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Half a cycle later, the string takes the opposite shape. Nodes stay still: both ends and the two interior crossing points.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"nodes","on":"string","marks":[{"kind":"fn","id":"opposite","y":"-sin(pi*x/2)","domain":[0,6],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"point","id":"nodeone","at":{"on":"crest","x":2},"label":"node"},{"kind":"point","id":"nodetwo","at":{"on":"crest","x":4},"label":"node"}]},{"op":"text","id":"nodedef","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.12},"content":"Nodes: zero displacement at all times"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.warning","request_id":"8a9f711d-2cff-4f75-9431-b9d5b2d30c42","code":"step_repaired","step_hint":"s3"}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"8a9f711d-2cff-4f75-9431-b9d5b2d30c42","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Antinodes move most, midway between nodes. Adjacent nodes are half a wavelength apart; a node and its nearest antinode are a quarter wavelength apart.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"antinodes","on":"string","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"antione","at":{"on":"crest","x":1},"label":"antinode"},{"kind":"point","id":"antitwo","at":{"on":"crest","x":3}},{"kind":"point","id":"antithree","at":{"on":"crest","x":5}},{"kind":"segment","from":[1,-1],"to":{"on":"crest","x":1},"arrow":true},{"kind":"segment","from":[3,1],"to":{"on":"crest","x":3},"arrow":true},{"kind":"segment","from":[5,-1],"to":{"on":"crest","x":5},"arrow":true},{"kind":"measure","from":[2,-1.35],"to":[4,-1.35],"label":"λ/2"}]},{"op":"text","id":"antidef","anchor":{"el":"nodedef","side":"below","gap":0.1},"content":"Antinodes: maximum oscillation amplitude"},{"op":"equation","id":"spacing","anchor":{"el":"antidef","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"d_{\\text{node to antinode}}=\\frac{\\lambda}{4}"}],"checkpoint":null}}
